 "text": "Tripp County Verteran Services Office - TRIPP COUNTY\nTRIPP COUNTY\nHome\nABOUT\nDIRECTORY\nCOMMISSIONERS\nNOTICES/BIDS\nEmployment\nVeteran Services\n200 E. 3rd St Ste. 108\nWinner, SD 57580\n​Contact: (605) 842-1300\nVeteran's Service Officer: Milton Douglas\n​\nServices: ​Veterans, their dependents, and the survivors of veterans are encouraged to contact our office to inquire about benefits to which they may be entitled.\n​​\n|\nHours:\n​Tuesday & Wednesday\n​7:30 AM - 4:00 PM\n|\nCourt House Hours:\n​ * Some offices are only open certain days. Please visit the office directory page for specific office hours.\n​\nFollow us on Facebook!\nSite powered by Weebly. Managed by HostCentric\nHome\nABOUT\nDIRECTORY\nAmbulance Billing & Welfare\nCounty Auditor\nClerk of Court\nEqualization Office\nExtension Office\n>\nTripp County Fair Board\nHighway Department\nRegister Of Deeds\nSheriff\nState Attorney\nTreasurer\nTripp County Ambulance\nTripp County Library Grossenburg Memorial\nVeteran Services\nWeed & Pest Management\nCOMMISSIONERS\nAgenda\nTripp County Minutes\nNOTICES/BIDS\nEmployment\nAmbulance Billing & Welfare\nCounty Auditor\nClerk of Court\nEqualization Office\nExtension Office\n>\nTripp County Fair Board\nHighway Department\nRegister Of Deeds\nSheriff\nState Attorney\nTreasurer\nTripp County Ambulance\nTripp County Library Grossenburg Memorial\nVeteran Services\nWeed & Pest Management\nAgenda\nTripp County Minutes",
